<title>JAPAN: Walt Disney launches 4.8% yen/dlr samurai--Nikko.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney launches 4.8% yen/dlr samurai--Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following yen/dollar dual currency samurai bond issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Walt Disney Co</p>
<p> AMT		 30 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    4.8 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  14 Feb 2000</p>
</text>
